  "newContractFindings": [
    "Shared pdf_user_action_slip dispatches common$IDownloadSlipPdfUserAction, distinct from generic pdf_user_action. This descriptor alone does not prove every request UI button binding.",
    "Slip PDF action collects route data_sids into SecurityHisrotyInfo, chooses slip grid model, awaits inventory$SetSlipPrintPageViewProgram and inventory$ApplyAllSlipPrintViewProgram, then dispatches common$IDownloadPdfUserAction.",
    "SetSlipPrintPageViewProgram waits for rendering, caches templates and source bundles for all target slips; selection bundles are grouped by current template. ApplyAll builds each document, assembles all pages without current_page, mounts offscreen document identity for target IDs and can reuse a matching alive mount.",
    "Common PDF requires v3 menu metadata/menu type/grid model, validates current runtime page and row counts, invokes AddGridAllRow, and forwards non-basic template margins/paper/dimensions/orientation/reduce settings. 50 or more pages OR2000 or more rows are rejected in this common entry validator. This is a source contract, not own runtime acceptance.",
    "Print orientation H maps to L, otherwise P; size codes20 and1..6 map toA4,21A5,22B5,23Letter,Ucustom,7Auto. Default-basic settings are not overwritten by the non-basic branch.",
    "DownloadPdfProgram receives EditMode18/ProgramId/GbTypeY/PFlag9/IsFromEdmsfalse/SecurityHisrotyInfo plus printSetupOption and customization screen type. No actual permission server response was invoked.",
    "FileSecurityTitleInfoProgram builds a security-history description from menu/template and date range; this is not evidence of the downloaded filename. Actual binary/filename/download/error/timeout behavior remains in absent print$DownloadPdfProgram."
  ],
